This patch contains the final fixes and updates in order to ensure everyone has a smooth experience while playing the game. The patch is only available for Closed BETA-testers right now until we launch the game on 19-03-2015, which is tomorrow! Tomorrow this version will also go live for everyone. 

You can read the patch notes below:

[h1]Patch Notes[/h1]
[b]Features[/b]
- Added respawn timers for everyone to see;
- Added a death icon;
- Waves now start after everyone is finished loading their screens;
- Updated controller behavior.

[b]Weapons[/b]
- The rocket launcher can no longer shoot through the wall of the farmers house;
- Tweaked 'pistol' prices;
- Tweaked 'laser' fire power for base weapon and first upgrade.

[b]Maps[/b]
- Minor particle tweaks on the Map: Block Planet;
- Fixed missing particles on Map: Block Planet;
- Created mist in Map: Block Country Side;
- Fixed various holes in maps, where the player would fall down the map;
- Adjusted Fire particles;
- Added smoke to various maps; 
- Tweaked the amount of Tanks that spawn during wave 1 in Map: Block Crash Site;
- Overall performance fixes on all maps.

[b]General Fixes[/b]
- Tweaked the alien moving speed when playing on the difficulty 'Insane';
- Tweaks in all levels with SFX;
- Various performance fixes and tweaks;
- Enabled sub emitters;
- Removing some unnecessary debug messages;
- Fixed settings screen;
- Quitting a singleplayer game now brings you back to the map menu instead of the main menu;
- Cursor no longer disappears when a game is finished;
- Fixed an issue where the HUD camera had a collision box;
- Minor Collision tweaks throughout the entire game; 
- Minor particle tweaks in the main menu of the game; 
- Transparency around aliens mouths has been fixed;
- Replaced wrong collision material with the right material;
- Fixed issue where aliens would sometimes spawn and not move;
- Fixing a null reference exception for spawn indicators.

[b]Achievements[/b]
- The achievements that have been added to the game are now obtainable;
- The achievements regarding difficulty now use proper numbers;
- The amount of coins that need to be collected for the achievement 'Scrooge' has been reduced from 100.000.000 to 25.000.000.

